      "owner": "ADR-0044 / public hosted CI fact lanes",
      "note": "PR lanes are selected by changed inputs; required names always report. Measured axe is required and runs on PRs with frontend inputs, pushes to main and dispatch; unselected PR jobs report skipped. Main and dispatch run the full suite, including Integration tests (system-tests tier), Integration tests (module tier), and CI wall-clock attribution. Both integration tiers are main/dispatch-only and are not required checks. Main never cancels the running run.",
